## Installation

```bash
# Install the backend plugin
mise plugin install {{ project_name }} {{ repository_url }}

# Use in your project
mise use {{ project_name }}:tool@version
```

## Usage

```bash
# List available versions
mise ls-remote {{ project_name }}:tool

# Install a specific version
mise install {{ project_name }}:tool@version

# Use the tool
mise exec {{ project_name }}:tool@version -- tool-command
```

## Development

### Setup

```bash
# Install dependencies
mise install
luarocks install --tree=.luarocks --only-deps .
```

### Testing

```bash
# Run all tests
mise run test

# Run specific test file
mise run test-file -- -f spec/specific_spec.lua
```

### Linting and Formatting

```bash
# Check formatting
mise run lint

# Fix formatting
mise run format

# Type checking
mise run typecheck

# Run all CI checks
mise run ci
```
